+msgctxt "#41884"
+msgid "The mapping is done as the smallest of cards keeps up with it: the residual of a full enhancement layer is not decoded (the picture takes the resolution of its base layer, the colour of Dolby Vision kept), the composition is libplacebo's reshaping, and every other picture is measured. It does nothing while the frame-by-frame mapping is off; it takes effect from the next video."
+msgstr "逐帧映射按小显卡也跟得上的方式做：完整增强层的残差不解码（画面取其基层的分辨率，杜比视界的色彩保留），合成用 libplacebo 的重构，画面隔帧测量。仅在逐帧映射开启期间生效；自下一部视频起生效。"
